+**Tech Stack**:
+- **Frontend**: Next.js 14, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Leaflet
+- **Backend**: Express.js, Node.js 18+, PostgreSQL (Docker)
+- **Auth**: JWT with refresh token rotation (stateless, no sessions)
